bwTools implements the BigWig binary format in R.

The implementation was designed with reference to the BigWig structures and
algorithms present in libBigWig 0.4.8 source code supplied during development,
including its header, chromosome tree, R-tree, full-resolution data blocks,
zoom summary blocks, interval statistics, and writer layouts. No libBigWig
C/C++ source is compiled, linked, or shipped as part of bwTools.
